app-randomid3
 
Stateful set - pod will be created with the help of  ordinal index  . starts from 0 to N-1 [ N = number of replicas ]
It has unique and stable network identity . We can predict   network identity & Pod name in advance
 Pods are created / deleted In their naming order.   
Each pod will have dedicated storage using pvc 
